  "title": "VRRP: Change default method for VRRPv3 checksum calculation",
  "description": "The original VRRPv3 RFC\t(RFC5798) was ambiguous about how the checksum\nshould be calculated for IPv4. The latest VRRP RFC (RFC9568) clarifies,\nand it is the opposite of the default setting in Wireshark.\n\nThis commit changes the\tdefault\tsetting\tfor the\tchecksum calculation\n(g_vrrp_v3_checksum_as_in_v2) and updates the description of the flag.\n\nSigned-off-by: Quentin Armitage <quentin@armitage.org.uk>",
